WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.735
-Now, you can do your poker face
when you're looking at this.

00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:04.103
The acting starts now.
-Oh, it's a toaster oven.

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:07.740
[ Laughing ] Oh, yeah.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:09.275
-Okay.
-Okay.

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.978
-Alright.
-So...

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:14.747
inside my box...

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:17.183
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:22.555
-Oh, cool.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.991
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:27.393
That's interesting.

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:30.029
-Okay, so the audience
has now seen it.

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:32.598
Oh.

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:33.600
[ Laughs ]

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.535
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.746
[ Humming ]

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.521
So let's see.

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:00.827
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:06.266
Okay.

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:11.538
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.319
Oh.

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:27.420
Whoa.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.923
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.235
It's an everyday thing.

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:43.603
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:46.572
Here you go. This is where
you make your choice, yeah.

00:01:46.572 --> 00:01:48.207
[ Clears throat ]

00:01:48.207 --> 00:01:50.609
-It's a, um...

00:01:50.609 --> 00:01:52.111
It's an interesting thing.

00:01:52.111 --> 00:01:53.479
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:55.348
So, um...
-What?

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:56.883
"It's an interesting thing."

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:59.551
In my box...

00:01:59.551 --> 00:02:03.589
is what I assume to be...

00:02:03.589 --> 00:02:07.827
shavings of a pickle...

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:10.863
in the shape of a welcome mat,
a tiny welcome mat

00:02:10.863 --> 00:02:13.866
for possibly a dollhouse.

00:02:13.866 --> 00:02:18.070
-What is in my box is...

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:21.274
a bowl of chili
frozen in gelatin.

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:25.578
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.578 --> 00:02:28.581
-I'm very familiar with this.
-Okay.

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:33.453
-It's ice cream in a...

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:36.321
looks like a Houston Astros hat,
a baseball --

00:02:36.321 --> 00:02:37.890
upside-down baseball hat.

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.525
[ Laughs ]

00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:40.926
Why are you laughing?

00:02:40.926 --> 00:02:43.896
Pumpkin with "pisghetti" on it.

00:02:43.896 --> 00:02:45.498
-Spaghetti.

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.266
-Yeah, I wanted to see
if you were acting.

00:02:47.266 --> 00:02:49.969
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:51.771
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:54.073
-It is, um...

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:57.677
a Rubik's Cube inside jello.

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:00.914
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.749 --> 00:03:04.150
-Hmm.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:05.584
[ Applause ]

00:03:05.584 --> 00:03:08.421
So it's like a pencil sharpener
type of thing.

00:03:08.421 --> 00:03:10.656
Where, uh...

00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:13.993
Where you put the pencils
or whatever, you put a, uh --

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:15.695
you put a pretzel stick.

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:17.797
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:19.565
In a dude's mouth.

00:03:19.565 --> 00:03:22.301
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.301 --> 00:03:25.804
-It is...
-A potato.

00:03:25.804 --> 00:03:27.907
-Close.
-Hmm.

00:03:27.907 --> 00:03:32.678
-It is a plastic...

00:03:32.678 --> 00:03:34.447
cup.
-Mm-hmm.

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:40.887
-It's a plastic cup
filled with beans.

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:43.156
Uh, baked beans.

00:03:43.156 --> 00:03:44.323
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.323 --> 00:03:46.225
It's a cup of beans.

00:03:46.225 --> 00:03:48.094
-Wait, wait, wait, wait.

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:50.029
[ Chuckles ]

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:57.436
A vibrating jello mold
of Jeff Goldblum.

00:03:57.436 --> 00:03:59.572
[ Laughs ]

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:07.747
-In my box was a very thick,
red, gelatinous teddy bear

00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:10.650
swaddled in a blanket
with a Binky in its mouth.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.552
[ Laughter ]

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:18.391
-[ Laughs ]
So it's a miniature hot tub.

00:04:18.391 --> 00:04:20.660
-Oh, yeah, it's a porcelain --
It's a decent purchase.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:22.861
It's something you get
in "TV Guide."

00:04:22.861 --> 00:04:24.063
You can order it in "TV Guide."

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:25.999
It's, like,
from the Franklin Mint.

00:04:25.999 --> 00:04:27.032
Yeah.

00:04:27.032 --> 00:04:29.035
-It's a pepperoni pizza.

00:04:29.035 --> 00:04:31.437
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:31.437 --> 00:04:33.572
Oh, my goodness.

00:04:33.572 --> 00:04:34.740
You lie!

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:36.175
-You suck!

00:04:36.175 --> 00:04:39.378
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:39.378 --> 00:04:42.114
-Oh, my gosh, is that Chewbacca?
[ Laughs ]

00:04:42.114 --> 00:04:44.149
You were right!

00:04:44.149 --> 00:04:46.151
[ Laughs ]

00:04:46.151 --> 00:04:47.754
-Eat this, Jimmy Fallon!

00:04:47.754 --> 00:04:50.622
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:50.622 --> 00:04:52.892
[ Laughs ]

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:53.926
-I tell the truth.

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:55.762
-Oh!

00:05:01.767 --> 00:05:03.402
I don't know what to do.
I don't even know --

00:05:03.402 --> 00:05:05.905
That's so bizarre, I didn't know
how to make anything up.

00:05:05.905 --> 00:05:08.674
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:08.674 --> 00:05:11.243
-Ah! What is that?

00:05:11.243 --> 00:05:12.277
-It's weird, right?

00:05:12.277 --> 00:05:14.747
-Beans, beans, beans!

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:16.148
Beans!

00:05:16.148 --> 00:05:19.118
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:19.118 --> 00:05:21.054
-[ Laughs ]

00:05:25.057 --> 00:05:26.391
-How could I even lie?

00:05:26.391 --> 00:05:28.994
After I saw this, how could I
make up a lie about that?

00:05:28.994 --> 00:05:30.897
Most insane thing
I've ever seen in my life.

